OneiOS rt 0005: DeviceOptions::dont_care_stores: Metal's DontCare and MultisampleResolve stores as DONT_CARE where the consumer measured its driver keep either Metal answer (Turnip: 37 ms -> 9 ms a full-screen pass of 64 blended draws; Droid-VM 0021). Off by default: not sound where rt splits a pass (a split rendering loads what the DONT_CARE store left unwritten, 2026-11-28), so it is only an A/B.

